ction":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":11804,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈颂七十六首 其三十四","author":"释师观","text":"弥勒真弥勒，分身千百亿。\n时时示时人，时人俱不识。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":11805,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈颂七十六首 其二十九","author":"释师观","text":"蓦然平地一声雷，惊得蟭螟眼豁开。\n是圣是凡俱不立，何妨随处舞三台。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":11806,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈颂七十六首 其十四","author":"释师观","text":"去去实不去，来来实不来。\n去来如梦幻，虚空绝点埃。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":11807,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈颂七十六首 其九","author":"释师观","text":"日日是好日，时时是好时。\n只为分明极，翻令所得迟。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":11808,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈颂七十六首 其八","author":"释师观","text":"结夏又十日，个事作么生。\n无风荷叶动，决定有鱼行。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":11809,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈颂七十六首 其四","author":"释师观","text":"法法不隐藏，今古露堂堂。\n更进这一步，明明为举扬。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e